ot;,[&quot;string&quot;,&quot;str&quot;]],[&quot;current&quot;,[&quot;integer&quot;,&quot;i64&quot;]],[&quot;longest&quot;,[&quot;integer&quot;,&quot;i64&quot;]],[&quot;status&quot;,[&quot;string&quot;,&quot;str&quot;]]]' data-show-filters='true' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Productive aberration</strong> \u2014 output arriving without Reveal, i.e. from outside the rules</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>{'days': 0, 'share_of_producing_days': None, 'channel': 'Reveal', 'events': []}</code></span></span><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Adherence without production</strong> \u2014 the quiet precursor to stagnation</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>insufficient data</code></span></span></div>"
