          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"the-evolving-posterior-belief-over-time\">The evolving posterior \u2014 belief over time</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><em>What's asking:</em> how has the system's belief in the practice-level\ncompletion rate moved as evidence accumulated? <em>How:</em> each day's snapshot\nis one interval; laid side by side they are the credible band narrowing\n(or refusing to). <em>How to read:</em> the band should tighten as days\naccumulate; a band that jumps marks a genuine shift in the practice, not\nnoise \u2014 that is what \"rolling Bayesian\" buys.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
